# The root package is npm (package-lock.json is the tracked lockfile here).
# A stray pnpm-lock.yaml at the root would be a second lockfile for the same
# dependencies, with nothing saying which one wins. Root-anchored on purpose:
# site/ genuinely uses pnpm and its site/pnpm-lock.yaml stays tracked.
/pnpm-lock.yaml
